    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ SECTION 26 ============ -->
  <div class="section-header" id="s26"><span class="num">26</span><h2>Related Provisions — Cross-Reference Map</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
  <div class="grid">
    <div class="card cd span2">
      <div class="ctitle cd">How §§246–251 connect across HGB Book 3</div>
      <div class="td-table">
        <div class="th cols-08-2"><span>Provision</span><span>Nature of the connection</span></div>
        <div class="tr cols-08-2"><span>§§252–256a</span><span>Supplies the MEASUREMENT rules (discounting, cost bases) that determine the AMOUNT at which a recognised item under this Titel is carried</span></div>
        <div class="tr alt cols-08-2"><span>§266</span><span>Prescribes the exact balance sheet line items — including RAP as its own named category — that this Titel's recognition rules populate</span></div>
        <div class="tr cols-08-2"><span>§274</span><span>Deferred tax recognition, itself closely intertwined with temporary differences arising from this Titel's own recognition choices</span></div>
        <div class="tr alt cols-08-2"><span>§285</span><span>Requires further Anhang disclosure elaborating on Rückstellungen and Haftungsverhältnisse recognised or disclosed under this Titel</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
