  <!-- ============ SECTION 27 ============ -->
  <div class="section-header" id="s27"><span class="num">27</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
  <div class="three-col">
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Wirtschaftliches Eigentum</div><div class="glossary-def">Economic ownership — the substance-over-form doctrine attributing an asset to the party with substantive economic control, not merely legal title.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Numerus clausus (of Rückstellungen)</div><div class="glossary-def">The closed, statutory list of cases for which a provision may be recognised under §249 — no general, open-ended category exists.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Kulanzrückstellung</div><div class="glossary-def">A provision for a warranty-style obligation the enterprise has no legal duty to honour, but customarily does, as established business practice.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Rechnungsabgrenzungsposten (RAP)</div><div class="glossary-def">A distinctly named, legally defined balance sheet category for accrued/deferred expense and income items spanning the balance sheet date.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Damnum / Disagio</div><div class="glossary-def">The difference between a loan's nominal repayment amount and the (lower) amount actually disbursed, capitalisable as an active RAP item.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Haftungsverhältnisse</div><div class="glossary-def">Contingent liability relationships (e.g. guarantees) disclosed below the balance sheet line or in the Anhang, rather than recognised.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="legend">
    <div class="ltitle">Key</div>
    <div class="lrow">
      <span class="badge bs">Bilanz</span> Balance sheet
      <span class="badge bp">GuV</span> Income statement (Gewinn- und Verlustrechnung)
      <span class="badge be">Anhang</span> Notes to the financial statements
    </div>
  </div>
